[[File:December 2009 partial lunar eclipse-cropped.jpg|right|thumb|A '''blue moon''' photographed during the {{w|December 2009 lunar eclipse}}.]]

{{Wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-blue moon.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|countable}} An extra [[full moon]] that appears in a [[subdivision]] of a [[year]], namely:
## The third full moon in a [[season]] that contains four rather than the usual three full moons.
## The [[second]] of two full moons that occur in the same [[calendar month]] (a definition created by mistake in the 20th century).
# {{lb|en|countable|rare}} The [[moon]] [[tinted]] towards [[blue]] as it appears in the [[sky]], caused by [[dust]] or [[smoke]] in the [[atmosphere]].
# {{lb|en|countable|idiomatic|by extension}} A [[long]] [[time]].
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} A bright blue, [[sweet#Noun|sweet]]-flavored [[ice cream]] that is popular in the [[w:Midwestern United States|Midwestern U.S.]] and is a component of [[Superman]] ice cream.

